{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 在 macOS 27.3 beta 1 加入名為 Pro Light 的螢幕保護程式，將全新觸控螢幕 MacBook Pro 的 PROLED XDR Display 桌布轉為動態版本。</p>\n<h2>Pro Light 光影沿線條流動</h2>\n<p>Apple 為標誌新款 MacBook Pro 登場而設計這款搶眼桌布，延續把產品名稱融入設計的做法，以一系列流動、帶金屬感的線條拼出「PRO」字樣。macOS 27.3 beta 1 提供的 Pro Light 螢幕保護程式，會讓光線沿這些金屬感線條緩慢移動，逐段照亮「PRO」字樣的不同部分，其餘位置則漸變昏暗。</p>\n<h2>設計被指似螢幕故障</h2>\n<p>這款桌布設計亦引起兩極反應，部分用戶稱它令人聯想到畫面故障或螢幕損壞。有評論認為，考慮到近日有報道指 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 出現螢幕問題，這個時機尤其不利。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 macOS 27 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/macos-golden-gate-01.webp\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:06:25.341372+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:52:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:19:04.055542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:00:00.304163+00:00","content_hash":"324ee1ca9bf95b165e0329cda2d8617a670ea9588e75ab7714d7eb4680c7a6df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}